Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.23,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-This really is really \Ncramped for two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:12.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I have to say, those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.08,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:18.12,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.64,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:25.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're trapped in a very \Nsticky situation right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:34.11,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:43.73,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.81,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.59,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:55.82,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:58.07,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:01.12,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:06.61,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.84,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:12.59,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:18.84,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:20.42,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:25.13,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.34,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:30.84,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:31.67,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:36.45,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:39.45,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:45.88,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:02.30,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(38,310)\an1}#09 He Wants to {\c&H876ECC&}Talk{\c} Privately...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:58.74,Main,Yoshida/Ito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:02.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}As for how we ended up here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:07.10,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Meowtaro merchandise from 30 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:08.25,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:13.70,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,It's for the upcoming Meowtaro \N30th anniversary exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:17.81,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,It should be in storage in the basement \NCould you go look for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:19.47,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:22.74,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,It might be a bit much to do on your own, \Nso take Katase-san with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.74,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Got it! We'll go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.50,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H597059&\bord0\shad1\b1\4c&H263132&\fay.12\frx2\fry12\move(340,86.667,310,86.667)}General Affairs Office
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.50,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H597059&\bord0\shad1\b1\4c&H263132&\fay.1\frx2\fry12\fs16\move(448.667,236,418.667,236)}No Unauthorized Personnel Allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.50,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.01,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:36.63,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If it's from over 30 years ago, \Nwould it really...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:38.76,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:43.66,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,A Meowtaro pen case! \NI had one of these! This is so nostalgic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:47.39,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This place might be a treasure trove \Nto old-school Meowtaro fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:51.32,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, we should probably \Nfinish looking before the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:55.40,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I got a message from \Nthe manager on the office chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.90,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\shad0\c&H4E4F4C&\bord0\frz16.3\pos(244.666,188)\fax.1}Manager
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.90,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(269.333,233.333)\an7\fs12\shad0\c&H4E4F4C&\3c&HFAF4FB&\frz16.3\fax.1}It should be on one of the shelves in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:57.90,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,{\i1}It should be on one of the shelves in the back.{also what the text says, including the sender field}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.18,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,The back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:05.32,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,We've looked pretty much everywhere \Nup front, so let's head farther back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:06.41,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:08.91,Sign_Basic,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(424,142,455,142)\an9\c&H455051&\bord0\shad0\b1}Product Development
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:08.91,Main,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(424,212,455,212)\an9\c&H2C3437&\bord0\shad0\b1\fs20}Group 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:12.82,Flashback,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,What're you grinning about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:17.43,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,I feel like there's going to be \Na large helping of sugar served up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.25,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There's still so much stuff to look through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.10,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Where do we even start?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.43,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good question...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:32.44,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,For now, I'll start lowering \Nthe boxes on the upper shelves...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.16,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,No one's here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:38.94,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,No one comes all the way down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.43,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.66,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,But what if someone finds us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.45,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,We'll deal with that if it happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.70,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,296)\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HEFF0F0&\blur2}m 0 0 l 146 0 l 146 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.70,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,296)\an5\fs18\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1}Public Relations\N\N{\fs30\fscy140}Ito Yuri
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.70,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're from PR. That's Ito-san and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.70,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.00,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.50,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.96,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HEFF0F0&\blur2\pos(108,296)}m 0 0 l 146 0 l 146 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.96,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs18\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(108,296)}Public Relations\N\N{\fs26\fscy140}Yoshida Masao
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.32,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What're they doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.61,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Could it be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:56.46,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Be what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.96,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Th-Th-This might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:00.71,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:02.82,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.55,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.26,Flashback,Both,0,0,0,,Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.43,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wha—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.66,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:10.77,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-An office romance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:13.05,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,Gosh, Masa-tan, you're so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:15.56,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Only because you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:17.79,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,But we're working!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.53,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was about to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:23.96,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors, but... I didn't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:27.04,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, well, this is really something...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.53,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's super staring!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:31.37,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm getting nervous being by the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.69,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Does the thought of getting found excite you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:34.96,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.17,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've already been found, actually.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:41.92,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,It's not that, but if we're going to \Nhave fun, I wanna move to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:49.02,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-S-Senpai, they're coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:51.59,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I know! Wh-Where do we hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.62,Flashback,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.07,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:11.08,Flashback,Both,0,0,0,,Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Well, it's good that \Nwe were able to hide, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:19.84,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-This really is really \Ncramped for two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:23.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It is. I have to say, those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.47,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yuri-tan, Yuri-tan, oh, Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:28.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,How long are they going to \Nfool around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:31.45,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Masa-tan, Masa-tan, oh, Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I hope they don't plan on \Ndoing anything weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:33.39,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yuri-tan Yuri-tan Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.85,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No... I can't imagine \Nthey would, in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:34.85,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Masa-tan Masa-tan Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:37.85,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,By the way... Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:44.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Well... sorry if I smell sweaty or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:50.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Since it's you... I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:53.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:06:01.59,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-S-Senpai's ch-ch-chest...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.88,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:07.15,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's okay, we're safe, \Nsince I was able to catch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:15.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:15.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay, it's okay, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't take more of this! \NI need to get away soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:21.06,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.65,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somebody, chase those two off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:22.65,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.03,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There has to be a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:33.23,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai! The office chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:37.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Use it to lure them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:43.34,Sign_Basic,Sign(bottom),0,0,0,,{\an5\fs12\shad0\c&H3B3E3D&\bord0\pos(145.334,303.333)}Basement
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:40.52,Main,Yoshida/Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.34,Main,Shinozaki/Shiori,0,0,0,,Yay, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, hurry and contact them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:50.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.47,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:55.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When we hid in the locker before...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:59.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I put my phone in my back pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:04.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Could you please get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sh-She's asking me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:12.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Reach around to h-her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:13.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}My hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Can't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I move some?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:29.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll be careful not to make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:34.22,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Don't be embarrassed. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:37.60,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Come on, if you touch me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Not quite there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.20,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.74,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.55,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:47.11,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.83,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.74,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:57.74,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\an7\fs8\shad0\c&H4E4F4C&\bord0\fax.1\move(262,46,262,173)\frz18.16}Katase
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:57.74,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\an7\fs12\shad0\c&H4E4F4C&\3c&HFAFDFA&\move(292,108,292,235)\frz20.79}Emergency!\NPlease come to the fifth floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:56.16,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.74,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Katase-san's calling us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:01.37,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,That's bad! We need to hurry \Nor she'll realize we've been slacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.59,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,L-Looks like that worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:18.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:23.27,Sign_Basic,Book sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\c&H8EC4F9&\3c&H4A566D&\4c&HF7F9F9&\shad2}Nice to meet you!\N{\c&H76A6F4&}I'm {\c&H5270AD&}M{\c&HF6F9F7&}eow{\c&H5270AD&}t{\c&HF6F9F7&}aro\N{\b0\c&H465588&\3c&HF8FCF9&\shad0\fs16}Meow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:22.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:26.02,Main,Both,0,0,0,,The Meowtaro merchandise we were looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.72,Main,Both,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess that's our silver lining!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:30.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:36.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,W-We should hurry back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:38.28,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.57,Italics,Akina,0,0,0,,Twinge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.36,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I sense something... powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:47.48,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.92,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\fs18\c&H0D0D0D&\bord4\shad0\b1\an1\pos(345,350)\3c&HFDFFFD&}Preciousness is detected\Nwith one's sixth sense.{also sign}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.92,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Preciousness is detected \Nwith one's sixth sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:21.46,Italics,Shiori/Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm gonna \Nbe able to sleep tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:29.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's round and soft?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:45.14,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ended up not getting any sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:51.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't sleep at all last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:05.95,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\i1}My subordinates have been \Nacting weird since yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:11.96,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be there's been \Nnew developments of some kind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:20.59,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I didn't get much sleep, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:24.10,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Li'l bro. It seems there's something \Nnew with you and Shiorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What are you doing here on \Na workday, first thing in the morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:37.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an7\fs9\shad0\bord2\pos(140,63.667)\3c&H81685A&}Manager-san
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:37.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fs8\shad0\c&H696A6A&\an7\3c&HFEFEFD&\pos(158.666,132)}I sense lovey vibes between your brother\Nand Katase-san
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:37.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fs8\shad0\c&H3C6358&\an7\3c&HABE9D2&\pos(211.333,191.333)}Say... what? I must\Nconfirm at once
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:30.35,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fs8\shad0\c&H696A6A&\an7\3c&HFEFEFD&\pos(164.667,254)}Please do. I can handle things on\Nthis end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:37.61,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\fs8\shad0\c&H3C6358&\an7\3c&HABE9D2&\pos(239.333,298.667)}Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.20,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Chihiro provided me with some updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Manager did that?! And why are you \Nsharing intel with my boss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:37.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Also, "Chihiro"?! \NHow close are you two anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Seriously, there's nothing \Ngoing on with Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:43.26,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff, sniff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.12,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:46.80,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,I can smell Shiorin on your suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:47.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:52.81,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,For her fragrance to be \Nso distinct on your clothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:57.83,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,I must assume you two \Nwere stuck together in a locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:59.55,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's an ace detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.17,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:08.12,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was trying to forget about it, \Nbut now because of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's in my head again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I still feel so anxious... \Nmaybe I should just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:19.19,Sign_Basic,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(455,142)\an9\c&H455051&\bord0\shad0\b1}Product Development
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:19.19,Main,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(455,212)\an9\c&H2C3437&\bord0\shad0\b1\fs20}Group 2
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.04,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today I... I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.27,Main,SHiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:29.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There's been a delivery. Would you mind \Naccompanying me to general affairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:36.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:48.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai's not acting any differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:52.41,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe she just thinks of what \Nhappened as a workplace accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:54.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:57.45,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}if there's a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:01.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}that she might feel the same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.14,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,May I have some of your time after work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:19.29,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There's something \NI'd like to discuss privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:24.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:29.22,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Man, Meowtaro is honestly so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:33.12,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,I know what you mean. The way \Nhe's so floppy is weirdly addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:37.48,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You can really see how he was able to be \Nthe company's big attraction for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:40.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}He wants to talk privately...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:43.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder what about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}maybe it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:52.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:54.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What did you want to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:00.07,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:08.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I love you! Please, go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:13.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-Th-That's a little too big of a jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:19.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I-It could be something else, like needing \Nadvice about work or personal advice, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:20.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:25.34,Main,SHiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}if it really is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.26,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Oh, did you hear, Katase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.54,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Yoshida-san from PR is getting reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yoshida-san...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:43.80,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,He was apparently fooling around \Nwith Ito-san while on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:46.60,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,There were a ton of witnesses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.05,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,They were so into each other \Nthey probably didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:55.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess with office romances, \Nsomeone will need to get reassigned, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:14:00.31,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,I dunno. I think this is mostly \Nabout it affecting their work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:06.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Reassignment...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.67,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,It's kind of a shock, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:18.08,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,700)\fs18\c&H0D0D0D&\bord4\shad0\b1\an2\3c&HFDFFFD&\pos(78.667,178.667)}The way\Nthey were\Nbefore
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:15.88,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,I always thought those two \Nwere pretty cool and impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.32,Main - Top,Yoshida,0,0,0,,All right, let's move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:14.62,Main - Top,Ito,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.06,Main - Top,Yoshida,0,0,0,,I've got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.53,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.59,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(725,700)\fs18\c&H0D0D0D&\bord4\shad0\b1\an2\3c&HFDFFFD&\pos(78.667,178.667)}The way\Nthey are\Nnow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.96,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.38,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.59,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:25.09,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,That is {\i1}such{\i0} a thing. Guys who\Nchange the second they get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:26.80,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is it really so common?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:32.72,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Oh, totally! They try to act cool \Nin front of their friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:35.80,Main,Playboy Shinozaki,0,0,0,,This? It's my chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:38.33,Main,Playboy Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Cute? I dunno. Isn't she average?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.68,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Or they try to white knight too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:44.54,Main,Playboy Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Isn't he staring at you too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.44,Main,Playboy Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Next time he looks, \NI think I'll let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.59,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Funnily enough, it's the serious, \Ndown-to-earth types
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.65,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,who tend to go haywire \Nwhen they get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:58.50,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,And worst of all are the ones \Nwho go infantile once they start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Infantile?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:03.75,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,I guess they want to be babied? \NThey want pats on the head and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:09.29,Main,Googoo Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Shenpai! Sweepy! Gib headpats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:13.58,Main,Motherly Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, if you insist. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:15.76,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,C-Cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:19.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I think that might be kind of nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:24.01,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you've always \Nhad shotacon vibes, Katase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:28.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm a... shota... shota... shota...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:36.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm a... shota...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:33.18,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,What's your type, Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:36.33,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,M-Me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.57,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Someone who does good work, who's kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:40.67,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,has a good head on their shoulders \Nand is understanding of my hobbies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:42.67,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,and always looks out for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.22,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,You're not gonna find a dreamboat like that \Nin reality. Come back down to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:49.34,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,What a fun topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.33,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Ito-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:55.33,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,It's true that women can make men change...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:56.26,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:59.78,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Men can change women, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:02.89,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:06.11,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,So this is where you've been, Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:07.86,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.31,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for leaving you alone like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.31,0:16:15.87,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,It's okay! Absence makes the heart grow fonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.52,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:19.37,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yes, it certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:21.37,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,Yuri-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:23.37,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:27.28,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Smoochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.72,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,They've gone totally, completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:29.88,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,...absolutely stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:30.86,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:33.07,Main,Yoshida,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yuri-tan, I'll never let you go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:34.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Totally, completely... absolutely stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:35.89,Main,Ito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Masa-tan, hold me tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:44.39,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That display in there \Nwas a little too spicy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Is that what would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Acting like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:56.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I left you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:17:00.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's okay! Absence makes the heart grow fonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:04.16,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.17,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Shiorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:08.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Takkun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:10.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Squeeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:14.01,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Totally, completely... absolutely stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:24.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm finally gonna tell Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:30.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't run away! I need to brace myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.41,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:44.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's always be good coworkers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:49.17,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to be totally, \Ncompletely, absolutely stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:53.20,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I think having a relationship \Nthat stays the same is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:57.58,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Because being totally, completely, \Nabsolutely stupid would be awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:03.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sorry, I kind of talked over you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:06.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What did you want to discuss, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:10.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was going to say the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:16.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We're on the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:25.95,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I was really worried you were having \Ntrouble with work or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:28.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you going home now? \NLet's head to the station together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.50,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:47.17,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:52.07,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,I still can't bring myself \Nto drink that bitter coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:56.55,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,So I sneakily toss in \Ntwo pinches of a sweet secret
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:19:00.77,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,And let it slowly spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:05.73,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,There's a local bakery \Nthat's only open sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:10.62,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Where I once had some toast that glittered
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:15.12,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,What is it that makes it so satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:19.29,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Almost like magic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:24.37,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,I find myself thinking about that kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:29.98,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,How the small things can be the most precious
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:34.77,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Deep inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:39.17,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,It's ever so bittersweet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:44.09,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,"Just being around you is enough"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:48.11,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Becomes my mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.40,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Baby like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.66,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Baby you're the sugar
