Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:08.06,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,{\i1}Magical Girl Shiorin{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.48,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,85)\c&H353738&\bord0\shad0}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.48,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H353738&\bord0\shad0\fs30\pos(316,280)}Action! Shiorin
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.48,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,"Action! Shiorin"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.48,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Big trouble, Shiorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.48,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yutakappi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.95,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Bad guys are attacking! \NThe Demon Lord has come to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:19.40,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.97,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Come on, Shiorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:21.74,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.37,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.36,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Stop this right now, Demon Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:35.58,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Magical Girl Shiorin is here to face you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.09,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,So, you've come, Magical Girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:47.56,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,I'm the new Demon Lord, \Nhere to take over for my predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:50.10,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to be working with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.66,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.41,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.65,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:06.09,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,I'm Magical Girl Shiorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.46,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.10,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,Oh, let me accept your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:15.63,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,I'll probably need a while \Nto get used to everything, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:19.90,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,It's only my third year doing this, so I know \Nthat everyone has to start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:21.43,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:31.26,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,You can go ahead \Nand put the business card away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.27,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:37.58,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,I know the timing can be kind of awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:39.40,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,I appreciate your consideration.
