Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:51.54,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H353738&\bord0\shad0\fs30\pos(316,280)}Disaster! Shiorin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.79,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:57.50,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Professor Haya Kawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:21:59.88,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,You won't be able to transform now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.99,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,With your transformation \Ncompact in this state...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:06.17,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,I was running and it fell out of my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:07.68,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,Like a cell phone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:08.44,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Da-ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:10.83,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.60,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,At a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.14,Main,Yutakappi,0,0,0,,Come on, Shiorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:15.63,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.63,0:22:16.78,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,We've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:20.40,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,It's older, but please, use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.44,Main,shiorin,0,0,0,,Th-That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.56,0:22:25.85,Main,Haya Kawa,0,0,0,,There's no other way right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.00,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:36.58,Main,New demon Lord,0,0,0,,So, you've come, Magical Giiiirl—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.20,Main,New demon Lord,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What happened to you?! What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.21,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,There was a bit of an incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:43.71,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,so I'm using an older model \Nof transformation compact...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.78,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,{\i1}The old days were hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.84,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,Defeating you when you aren't \Nat your best would mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:51.72,Main,New Demon Lord,0,0,0,,I'll take my leave, for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.35,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:55.53,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:59.03,Main,Former Demon Lord,0,0,0,,I suppose this might be a job for me, \Nas the previous Demon Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.85,0:23:02.98,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(382.5,239.333)\c&H464946&\bord0\shad0\b1}To be continued!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.29,0:23:01.54,Main,Shiorin,0,0,0,,To be continued!{also sign}
